{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01700",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 4.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.31,
      "end_seconds": 10.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Okay, yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.86,
      "end_seconds": 21.97,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, it's trouble falling asleep. I don't know what's causing it. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.6,
      "end_seconds": 25.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.96,
      "end_seconds": 30.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Ah, for about two weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.67,
      "end_seconds": 41.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.09,
      "end_seconds": 54.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "Let me think, I'd call it moderate. A warm bath helps a bit. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.81,
      "end_seconds": 57.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Have you been waking tired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.3,
      "end_seconds": 61.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Yes, that started yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.06,
      "end_seconds": 65.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "and what about snoring or weight change?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.81,
      "end_seconds": 69.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.1,
      "end_seconds": 74.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Did you get chest pain or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.96,
      "end_seconds": 78.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.77,
      "end_seconds": 83.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.45,
      "end_seconds": 87.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.39,
      "end_seconds": 92.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.47,
      "end_seconds": 97.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.51,
      "end_seconds": 121.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.7,
      "end_seconds": 139.4,
      "duration_seconds": 16.7,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. I only drink at family occasions. I live with my elderly mother. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.81,
      "end_seconds": 156.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.59,
      "end_seconds": 161.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Yeah, um, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.88,
      "end_seconds": 165.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.06,
      "end_seconds": 168.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "no, none"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.13,
      "end_seconds": 173.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.73,
      "end_seconds": 176.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.58,
      "end_seconds": 189.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "right, can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.72,
      "end_seconds": 205.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.98,
      "end_seconds": 226.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 113 over 81, temperature 36.8, heart rate 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.67,
      "end_seconds": 232.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.0,
      "end_seconds": 235.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.32,
      "end_seconds": 239.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.79,
      "end_seconds": 259.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "your blood pressure and pulse are normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.23,
      "end_seconds": 266.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.78,
      "end_seconds": 291.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be poor sleep habits, or it might be mild anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.65,
      "end_seconds": 296.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.22,
      "end_seconds": 322.13,
      "duration_seconds": 23.91,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's poor sleep habits, and we'll watch how it goes. Keep a fixed bedtime, no screens for an hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.79,
      "end_seconds": 324.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.63,
      "end_seconds": 329.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Let's review you in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 331.6,
      "end_seconds": 335.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Come by reception afterwards and I'll fix the appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.07,
      "end_seconds": 341.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.46,
      "end_seconds": 345.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Yeah, thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}